description: Status enums and active flags are always badges with i18n labels
alwaysApply: true
---

# Status

Never render a raw enum or boolean as text (`EM_ATENDIMENTO`, `ATIVO`, `true`).

- Display every status, role, level, type, payment method, and active flag with `StatusBadge`.
- Labels live in `apps/web/src/messages/*/status.json`. Fallback is `humanizeStatus`.
- Tones come from `toneFor` in `apps/web/src/lib/helpers/status.ts`.
- Booleans use `statusFromBoolean` (`ATIVO` / `INATIVO`).
- Buttons and select options may show the translated label, not a badge.
